WEBVTT

00:16:28.699 --> 00:16:31.929
They need to understand 
the well-rounded information

00:16:31.929 --> 00:16:35.940
around that problem, that challenge.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:40.948
So, for example, environment:
it is not only engineering elements,

00:16:40.948 --> 00:16:44.278
it is behavioral elements, 
it's an economical problem,

00:16:44.278 --> 00:16:45.598
it's a policy issue.

00:16:45.598 --> 00:16:48.478
So, we are trying to build 
our educational program

00:16:48.478 --> 00:16:52.368
around the multidisciplinary 
as very important elements.

00:16:52.714 --> 00:16:57.880
Second, it is around real-life type 
of research aspects.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:01.690
We want our students to engage
while they are in their education